<title>UK: L&amp;G shares up on results, dividend outlook.</title>
<headline>L&amp;G shares up on results, dividend outlook.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Legal and General Group Plc climbed on Thursday after the British insurer announced a 15.4-percent rise in operating profits and predicted strong dividend growth.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a good set of results and people are hoping for good dividends in the future,&quot; one market-maker said.</p>
<p>The shares were eight pence higher at 414 by 0845 GMT.  </p>
<p>&quot;The profits were pretty much bang in line with forecasts,&quot; another market-maker said. &quot;But their statement was positive and they look a good bet.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
